msgctxt "108"
msgid "You look like a good guy. Lend me a hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "My granny's coming up from the sticks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"I kinda told her I was a company president here in Kamurocho... which is "
"kinda... not true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "So I'm begging you⑬please! Pretend you work for me so I can keep up the lie!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Why should I have to do that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Granny's getting frail and was in a bad place for a while there. I thought "
"I'd cheer her up by telling her I was a big corporate hotshot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"I've been nothing but trouble since I was a little kid, so hearing I'd "
"become an upstanding member of society thrilled her to no end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Now she's out of the hospital and on her way here to see how I've been "
"doing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "But if she found out I was lying..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "I get where you're coming from, but you should just be honest with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I know... but I think there are times where a lie is "
"justified⑬necessary, even."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "So please... back me up on this! For my granny's sake!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Well, if you're that dead set on the idea, we'll have to make sure your lie "
"is airtight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Don't worry. I'm ready to take anything she throws at me. So what do you "
"say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"No, I'm not interested. I won't be part of some farce that involves duping "
"old women."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"If your grandmother's that important to you, go back home and take care of "
"her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Okay... Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Okay. I suppose I'll take a supporting role in the performance of your "
"lifetime⑬for your grandmother's sake, you understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Oh, thank you so much! You don't know how much this'll help me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Come over this way. Granny's waiting."
msgstr ""

